2023  3274              ; Score_Reset — score = 0, NextLifeScore = 50000 (new run / full restart).
2024  3274              ; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
2025  3274              Score_Reset:
2026  3274 21 00 00                     LD   HL, 0
2027  3277 22 A1 69                     LD   (Core.VDC_PlayerScore), HL
