4151  6690              ; UpdatePauseFade — runs each frame while VDC_DialogState=4 (pause "No" fade-out).
4152  6690              ; Board stays frozen (not-Play: no shot, no game-time). The pause window alpha
4153  6690              ; ramps down over PAUSE_FADE_FRAMES; when it expires -> DialogState=0 (PLAY).
4154  6690              UpdatePauseFade:
4155  6690 3E 01                        LD   A, 1
