4424  6914              ; Pause "No"/resume fade-out: VDC_DialogState=4 holds the board frozen (not-Play,
4425  6914              ; so frog can't shoot and game time stays frozen) while the pause window fades
4426  6914              ; out over PAUSE_FADE_FRAMES ticks; then -> PLAY. VDC_PauseAlpha (255=opaque)
4427  6914              ; scales the whole window's draw alpha during the fade.
4428  6914              PAUSE_FADE_FRAMES EQU 74        ; ~1 s at 74 Hz vsync
