 800+ 756B CD 6A 12                     CALL FT.WriteMem                         ; advances A:DE by BC
 801+ 756E C1                           POP  BC
 802+ 756F 10 F3                        DJNZ .wipe_loop
 803+ 7571 C9                           RET
