 982+ C64D              ; ============================================================================
 983+ C64D              VDC_TrySpawn:
 984+ C64D                              ; Public entry: с HSub==0 gate (sync с Python try_spawn).
 985+ C64D                              ; Fast phase обходит gate через VDC_TrySpawn_NoHsubGate.
