  20+ E05D                                                                    ; D=32: 30/46 was too magnetic on curved chain and
  21+ E05D                                                                    ; could pick a ball several slots before the aimed one.
  22+ E05D                                                                    ; 22/34 keeps a small touch margin without early capture.
  23+ E05D              BULLET_TRACKF_TUNNEL EQU #01                          ; track flags bit0: hidden/tunnel, not shootable.
