1730+ F25A              ; ZL_ChainMatrixLUT — pre-baked rotation matrices для 32 buckets (8 BRAD step).
1731+ F25A              ; Каждый bucket = 24 байта = 6 BITMAP_TRANSFORM_A..F opcodes. Sgnerированы
1732+ F25A              ; make_chain_matrix_lut.py (Q8.8 cos/sin, Q23.8 translation centered at +16/-16).
1733+ F25A              ; Bypass FT812 coprocessor — LDIR прямо в CMD буфер.
1734+ F25A              ; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
