1765+ F582              ; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
1766+ F582              ; FT812 frame profiler (diagnostic overlay).
1767+ F582              ; B/W/I are REG_CLOCK delta / 1024. At 60 MHz FT812 clock:
1768+ F582              ;   74 Hz frame ~= 792, 57 Hz frame ~= 1028.
1769+ F582              ; If B+W approaches frame budget and I is near zero, Z80/SPI path misses vblank.
1770+ F582              ; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
