 612+ C826              ; HL points at a WC path component. Copy it into RawPak_TargetName, uppercase and
 613+ C826              ; zero-terminate it. Returns HL at the next component (or #FF), CF=1 on success.
 614+ C826              RawPak_CopyWcComponent:
 615+ C826 11 2F CE                     LD   DE, RawPak_TargetName
