1098+ CBBF CD 94 C6                     CALL RawPak_FindByName          ; CF=1 найден → FileStartClus + FoundSize
1099+ CBC2 D2 2F CC                     JP   NC, .pbDone
1100+ CBC5 2A B0 CE                     LD   HL, (RawPak_FoundSize + 0)
