1338+ CDBC 95                           SUB  L
1339+ CDBD 5F                           LD   E, A
1340+ CDBE 7A                           LD   A, D
1341+ CDBF 9C                           SBC  A, H
1342+ CDC0 57                           LD   D, A
1343+ CDC1 D5                           PUSH DE
1344+ CDC2 11 06 00                     LD   DE, 6
1345+ CDC5 DD 19                        ADD  IX, DE
1346+ CDC7 D1                           POP  DE
1347+ CDC8 10 E1                        DJNZ .scan
1348+ CDCA DD E1                        POP  IX                            ; logical sector past EOF (bad TOC) -> error
1349+ CDCC 37                           SCF
