4486  EE23                              ; main1_play (#04), the UI overlay (#41) and the loader overlay (#40)
4487  EE23                              ; all assemble at logical #C000 on different physical pages. Map the
4488  EE23                              ; right page into the slot before EACH SAVEBIN, else SAVEBIN dumps
4489  EE23                              ; whichever page was mapped last into the wrong .bin — corrupting it.
4490  EE23                              SLOT 1
